<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Selling stolen goods firectly from your vehicle to the Purchaser</Major>
    <Description>This files are made for fast fullautomated selling of stolen goods from a vehicle, that you must place with open boot near you, so you dont have to go away from the Purchaser. An important thing is, that the Macro works fast and slow systems cant load the diffrent menus and inventorys that fast as sometimes required. You would have to stop in that case the Macro and to sell the goods manually, if the macro crashes after he transfered the goods into your inventory. To get a vehicle near you and the Purchaser you need a small vehicle or quad with boot. I recommand "Blazer Lifeguard" for that, cause you need to get cross the black market onto the railtracks and have to jump down there with the car , wwhere you fall into the black market area.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 12 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 12 1
Delay 200 ms
MoveTo 1039 429
//The product must be in your vehicle boot in the upper left corner near you so you can reach it, whithout having to walk away from the seller.
Delay 400 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 200 ms
MoveTo 1264 574
Delay 64 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 400 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 500 ms
MoveTo 886 706
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 400 ms
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 300 ms
MoveTo 1521 867
Delay 200 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 300 ms
MoveTo 959 847
Delay 300 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 400 ms
MoveTo 1006 435
//Change Position of the Move cursor to change the product you want to sell.
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 400 ms
MoveTo 887 762
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 400 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 64
MoveTo 883 747
Delay 200 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 200 ms
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>